    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Problem Statement"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8UthO6SBI88X"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "FedEx Logistics manages a vast global supply chain, handling shipments across multiple regions, countries, and industries. Efficient logistics operations are crucial to ensure timely deliveries, minimize freight costs, and improve customer satisfaction. However, challenges such as shipment delays, high transportation costs, and inconsistencies in vendor agreements (INCO terms) can impact overall supply chain efficiency. This project aims to analyze FedEx's logistics dataset to:\n",
        "\n",
        "Identify bottlenecks causing shipment delays. Optimize freight costs by evaluating shipment methods and vendor agreements. Detect patterns in delivery schedules to predict future delays."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MRBpnUoKJGZo"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Business Objective:"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Cj2AI4whJOEU"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This project aims to analyze FedEx's logistics dataset covering 10,324 global shipments to achieve three outcomes:\n",
        "\n",
        "DELIVERY OPTIMIZATION — Identify root causes of shipment delays across regions, vendors, and shipment modes, and quantify delay patterns to enable targeted operational improvements.\n",
        "\n",
        "FREIGHT COST OPTIMIZATION — Detect inefficiencies in freight spending by evaluating the cost-to-value ratio across shipment modes and vendor INCO terms, and recommend mode-switching strategies that balance cost and reliability.\n",
        "\n",
        "SUPPLY CHAIN TRANSPARENCY — Address data quality gaps in procurement and delivery records that currently prevent accurate lead time tracking, SLA monitoring, and predictive delay modeling.\n",
        "\n",
        "Success Metrics:\n",
        "\n",
        "Increase overall on-time delivery rate above 90%\n",
        "Reduce average freight cost per kg for non-urgent shipments by 15–20%\n",
        "Achieve >95% PO date documentation compliance across all countries\n",
        "Flag and eliminate negative lead time anomalies from reporting"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lWgPFmt2JPnY"
      }
    },
