        "**OVERALL PERFORMANCE SUMMARY**\n",
        "\n",
        "The analysis of 10,324 shipment records (cleaned to 8,279 valid records after removing missing Shipment Mode and Dosage entries) revealed that FedEx achieves an overall on-time delivery rate of 87.09% with an average lead time of 109.35 days (~3.5 months). While the on-time rate is reasonably strong, it falls short of the 90% target, and the high average lead time combined with significant freight cost variance indicates substantial room for improvement across three dimensions: delivery reliability, cost efficiency, and data quality.\n",
