        "\n",
        "**KEY FINDINGS BY BUSINESS OBJECTIVE**\n",
        "FINDING 1 — DELIVERY PERFORMANCE\n",
        "\n",
        "**What Was Found:**\n",
        "\n",
        "Shipment Mode Reliability (On-Time Rate):\n",
        "\n",
        "Air → 89.4% on-time | Avg Lead Time: 119 days\n",
        "Air Charter → 88.5% on-time | Avg Lead Time: 81 days\n",
        "Truck → 83.7% on-time | Avg Lead Time: 55 days\n",
        "Ocean → 82.3% on-time | Avg Lead Time: 177 days\n",
        "Key Observation:\n",
        "\n",
        "Air is the most reliable mode but paradoxically has the second longest lead time (119 days), suggesting delays happen in pre-shipment processing, not transit.\n",
        "Ocean freight takes an average of 177 days — nearly 6 months — and is the least reliable at 82.3% on-time.\n",
        "Truck is the fastest (55 days avg) but less reliable than Air, indicating last-mile execution issues.\n",
        "Country-Level Delays:\n",
